@HostAddress = https://localhost:7093

###
GET {{HostAddress}}
Accept: application/json

### GET categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### POST categories
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/lookup/categories
Accept: application/json

### PUT categories
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/lookup/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### DELETE categories
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/lookup/categories/1
Accept: application/json

