### Tickets (Paginated)
Get {{HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

### Tickets (details)
Get {{HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json


### Create ticket
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "client_id": "",
}

### Assign Employee to ticket
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "user_id": "",
}


### update ticket status
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "statsu": "2",
}

### Ticket Reply (Admin $ client)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/reply
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "message": "",
    "attachments" : []
}